          "text": "Bilateral orchiectomy is the treatment of choice.",
          "pdf_page": 1319,
          "printed_page": 1237,
          "column": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "Exploratory laparotomy for retained testicles.",
          "pdf_page": 1319,
          "printed_page": 1237,
          "column": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "Supportive care for dogs with bone marrow hypoplasia.",
